                           <description>The 8 LSB of THR registers are left aligned on 24-bit data entered to the DSP. The bits [15:8] of the 24-bit data are driven by the 8 LSB of THR registers to increase the dynamic range of the data sent to DSP. The bits [7:0] are driven by 0s.</description>
